#: ../../desktop/index.rst:3
msgid "Desktop Client"
msgstr "Cliant Deisce"

#: ../../desktop/index.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Nextcloud desktop client for Windows, macOS, and Linux keeps files "
"synchronized between your computer and your Nextcloud server."
msgstr ""
"Coinníonn cliant deisce Nextcloud do Windows, macOS agus Linux comhaid "
"sioncronaithe idir do ríomhaire agus do fhreastalaí Nextcloud."

